+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Aggregate Exp 3734/3735 into the real Thesis-A kill-gate part-(a) verdict.
+
+Spec: REQ-EBT-3736, SCENARIO-EBT-3736-PASS,
+SCENARIO-EBT-3736-UNTESTED, SCENARIO-EBT-3736-DIVERGED.
+"""
